WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.509 --> 00:00:01.342
- Mmm.

00:00:01.342 --> 00:00:02.282
- Did you poop?

00:00:02.282 --> 00:00:04.365
(laughs)

00:00:07.109 --> 00:00:09.225
- We are on vacation in
Puerto Vallarta, Mexico

00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:12.058
and we decided to try
some Mexican McDonald's.

00:00:12.058 --> 00:00:13.641
- Woo! Let's do it.

00:00:15.452 --> 00:00:16.294
- [Man With Hat] Whoa.

00:00:16.294 --> 00:00:17.127
- [Woman] What is this?

00:00:17.127 --> 00:00:18.006
- It has guacamole.

00:00:18.006 --> 00:00:18.839
- Oh.

00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:20.705
- It really does look fancier

00:00:20.705 --> 00:00:22.087
than the McDonald's from the US.

00:00:22.087 --> 00:00:26.261
- It also has pico de gallo,
which I'm really excited.

00:00:26.261 --> 00:00:27.116
- Oh.

00:00:27.116 --> 00:00:29.595
- Mmm. Mmhmm. It's like more full.

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:32.274
- American McDonald's the
bread is just a sponge.

00:00:32.274 --> 00:00:34.315
The bread definitely tastes more hardy.

00:00:34.315 --> 00:00:35.263
- It's very cheesy.

00:00:35.263 --> 00:00:36.855
- I would devour this.

00:00:36.855 --> 00:00:39.156
- It's like a mix between
a burrito and a burger.

00:00:39.156 --> 00:00:41.606
- Mmhmm. The flavors are very down home.

00:00:41.606 --> 00:00:43.412
- All of like Mexican
flavor in one burger.

00:00:43.412 --> 00:00:44.746
- When you can't decide between

00:00:44.746 --> 00:00:46.636
Mexican food or American food.

00:00:46.636 --> 00:00:47.904
- That would be a good option.

00:00:47.904 --> 00:00:50.584
- In the sauce counter,
they also had salsa verde

00:00:50.584 --> 00:00:52.094
and chimchurri.

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:53.535
- Oh!
- Spicy?

00:00:53.535 --> 00:00:56.705
- It's not spicy, but it's
a very interesting flavor.

00:00:56.705 --> 00:01:00.321
What really takes it to the
next level are these sauces.

00:01:00.321 --> 00:01:02.446
Oh, is that some barbecue sauce I see?

00:01:02.446 --> 00:01:04.295
- Yeah, it smells so
good right off the bat.

00:01:04.295 --> 00:01:05.996
A bunch of crispy things inside too.

00:01:05.996 --> 00:01:08.079
- Bacon, fried onions ...

00:01:09.417 --> 00:01:10.250
- Mmm.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.154
- It's a lot sweeter than I expected.

00:01:12.154 --> 00:01:14.302
I'm not a huge fan of fried things,

00:01:14.302 --> 00:01:15.495
but I would eat that burger.

00:01:15.495 --> 00:01:17.104
- Oh, what are these?

00:01:17.104 --> 00:01:17.937
- Fried onions?

00:01:17.937 --> 00:01:19.097
- See this is a little too much for me.

00:01:19.097 --> 00:01:20.255
They're getting too crazy.

00:01:20.255 --> 00:01:21.337
- It's a little too sweet though.

00:01:21.337 --> 00:01:22.606
I feel like the barbecue's just like ...

00:01:22.606 --> 00:01:23.439
- Overwhelming.

00:01:23.439 --> 00:01:24.272
- It's a lot.

00:01:24.272 --> 00:01:25.357
- I love things that are supposed

00:01:25.357 --> 00:01:26.385
to be savory but a little bit of sweet.

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:27.552
- Sweet. Yeah.

00:01:28.771 --> 00:01:30.289
- This one was queso pie.

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:31.122
- So ...

00:01:32.795 --> 00:01:33.628
What?

00:01:33.628 --> 00:01:34.703
(laughing)

00:01:34.703 --> 00:01:36.841
- I've never heard of this item.

00:01:36.841 --> 00:01:38.835
- I'm intrigued. Cheese pie?

00:01:38.835 --> 00:01:39.918
- I don't ...

00:01:41.158 --> 00:01:42.115
- Oh!

00:01:42.115 --> 00:01:42.995
- It's so good.

00:01:42.995 --> 00:01:44.876
- Oh, yeah. Mmm. Mmm.

00:01:44.876 --> 00:01:46.792
- It's really good.

00:01:46.792 --> 00:01:48.068
- It's like soft flan.

00:01:48.068 --> 00:01:48.918
- It's really good.

00:01:48.918 --> 00:01:50.140
- Do we have two of these?

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:52.128
- It literally is just like cheesecake

00:01:52.128 --> 00:01:54.970
overflowing stuff in a
pie and it's delicious.

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.749
- And I love McDonald's apple pies,

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:59.184
but this was really really good.

00:01:59.184 --> 00:02:01.669
Oh, I love potato wedges. Give me those.

00:02:01.669 --> 00:02:05.209
Well we have potato wedges in
the US, but not at McDonald's.

00:02:05.209 --> 00:02:06.728
- [Man With Hat] I'm gonna dip it in this.

00:02:06.728 --> 00:02:08.298
- Mmm. Ah, these are incredible.

00:02:08.298 --> 00:02:10.117
- I wish McDonald's in the US had these.

00:02:10.117 --> 00:02:11.668
- It's hard to mess up potato wedges,

00:02:11.668 --> 00:02:13.920
and they definitely have
not messed these up.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:15.659
- Brings me back to school lunches.

00:02:15.659 --> 00:02:17.580
- You always talk about
your school lunches

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.368
and they were clearly way better

00:02:19.368 --> 00:02:21.047
than any of our school lunches.

00:02:21.047 --> 00:02:22.660
- [Man With Hat] Jalapeno cheese bites.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.940
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:24.958
- [Man With Hat] So different.

00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:26.276
- There are so many good things.

00:02:26.276 --> 00:02:29.147
- They kind of remind me of donut holes.

00:02:29.147 --> 00:02:31.647
Doesn't taste like donut hole.

00:02:32.776 --> 00:02:33.759
- Yep.

00:02:33.759 --> 00:02:35.738
- [Man With Hat] It's like
string cheese, deep fried.

00:02:35.738 --> 00:02:37.149
- That' really good, I love those flavors;

00:02:37.149 --> 00:02:38.348
cheese and jalapeno.

00:02:38.348 --> 00:02:39.787
- Kinda reminds me of nacho cheese

00:02:39.787 --> 00:02:41.577
with jalapeno cheese mixed into it.

00:02:41.577 --> 00:02:43.237
- I don't know if I could do the spicy

00:02:43.237 --> 00:02:44.277
with my McDonald's.

00:02:44.277 --> 00:02:45.708
- Really? I could.

00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:49.816
- But the cheese is good.
Might make me farty later.

00:02:49.816 --> 00:02:52.392
- Cajeta is my new best friend,
since I've been in Mexico.

00:02:52.392 --> 00:02:53.393
- Do you know what it is?

00:02:53.393 --> 00:02:54.333
- It's like caramely.

00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:57.101
- Caramelized goat milk.

00:02:57.101 --> 00:02:57.934
- Mmm.

00:02:57.934 --> 00:03:00.154
- It's really refreshing,
even though it's really sweet.

00:03:00.154 --> 00:03:02.735
- Look at how tiny it ... See,
they care about our health.

00:03:02.735 --> 00:03:05.115
US McFlurrys are like, bah!

00:03:05.115 --> 00:03:07.881
- I just like cajeta because
it gives you nice aftertaste.

00:03:07.881 --> 00:03:09.815
- I feel fancier eating this.

00:03:09.815 --> 00:03:12.043
- If you're a caramel
lover, you'll like this.

00:03:12.043 --> 00:03:15.176
- My favorite thing was
the cheese queso pie.

00:03:15.176 --> 00:03:16.685
- The queso pie was amazing.

00:03:16.685 --> 00:03:19.104
- I really enjoyed the guacamole one.

00:03:19.104 --> 00:03:21.387
Just put like a spread of
that chimichurri sauce.

00:03:21.387 --> 00:03:23.075
- I really like the chimichurri sauce

00:03:23.075 --> 00:03:24.397
and how well it goes with everything.

00:03:24.397 --> 00:03:26.674
- The cheese balls and
the wedges were so good

00:03:26.674 --> 00:03:27.697
I could eat those all day.

00:03:27.697 --> 00:03:29.447
- Every time I have
international McDonald's,

00:03:29.447 --> 00:03:31.915
it's always slightly
better than US McDonald's.

00:03:31.915 --> 00:03:33.226
- We just have higher standards.

00:03:33.226 --> 00:03:34.692
- Yeah.

00:03:34.692 --> 00:03:35.988
- Now I'm gonna go eat more cheese balls.

00:03:35.988 --> 00:03:37.821
- And go poop.
- Yeah.

00:03:40.236 --> 00:03:41.736
- [Woman] And cut.

